				"sections": [
					{
						"title": "Fixes",
						"collapsed": false,
						"entries": [
							"- **Update Pina AMM to 0.2.1 and regenerate CPI docs.** Regenerate `pina_bonding_curve_cpi` with `pina` CLI 0.25.1, adding program-level doc comments to `PINA_BONDING_CURVE_ID` with no wire or public API changes. The vendored `pina_amm` CPI crate is re-imported against `pina-rs/amm` v0.2.1 (`0ca40de5`) on `pina` 0.25, dropping the duplicate `pina 0.23.0` dependency from `Cargo.lock` so the deployed program binary shrinks by 48 bytes (`116,240 -> 116,192 B`) and `graduate` drops 16.84% in compute units (`68,581 -> 57,032 CU`). No API or source changes occur in the Rust, TypeScript, or Dart clients or the CLI.\n  _Packages:_ 🟢 _pina_bonding_curve_cpi_\n  _Owner:_ [@ifiokjr](https://github.com/ifiokjr) · _Review:_ [PR #39](https://github.com/pina-rs/bonding_curve/pull/39)"
						]
					}
				]
			},
			"rendered": "## [0.2.2](https://github.com/pina-rs/bonding_curve/releases/tag/v0.2.2) (2026-11-27)\n\nGrouped release for `bonding_curve`.\n\n### Fixes\n\n- **Update Pina AMM to 0.2.1 and regenerate CPI docs.** Regenerate `pina_bonding_curve_cpi` with `pina` CLI 0.25.1, adding program-level doc comments to `PINA_BONDING_CURVE_ID` with no wire or public API changes. The vendored `pina_amm` CPI crate is re-imported against `pina-rs/amm` v0.2.1 (`0ca40de5`) on `pina` 0.25, dropping the duplicate `pina 0.23.0` dependency from `Cargo.lock` so the deployed program binary shrinks by 48 bytes (`116,240 -> 116,192 B`) and `graduate` drops 16.84% in compute units (`68,581 -> 57,032 CU`). No API or source changes occur in the Rust, TypeScript, or Dart clients or the CLI.\n  _Packages:_ 🟢 _pina_bonding_curve_cpi_\n  _Owner:_ [@ifiokjr](https://github.com/ifiokjr) · _Review:_ [PR #39](https://github.com/pina-rs/bonding_curve/pull/39)"
		}
